  "title": "Vietnamese Rice Noodle Salad",
  "description": "Cooked rice noodles are mixed with carrots, cucumbers, mint, and napa cabbage. A sauce made with cilantro, jalapeno peppers, lime juice, fish sauce, and sugar is spooned on top.",
